1
00:01:06,029 --> 00:01:08,685
She said she wanted
to forget about Lorenz.

2
00:01:08,899 --> 00:01:09,983
After that...

3
00:01:10,522 --> 00:01:13,274
she never reached out to Lorenz again.

4
00:01:14,370 --> 00:01:16,581
Belle is just resting, Nanang Barbs.

5
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,708
I'll be with you for now.

6
00:01:19,375 --> 00:01:22,128
Belle doesn't like her
other personalities.

7
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,715
So whatever’s going on
between you and Ysabelle,

8
00:01:25,715 --> 00:01:27,050
you need to stop it.

9
00:01:28,593 --> 00:01:29,719
I miss you, Ysa.

10
00:01:30,595 --> 00:01:32,013
Who the heck is this Estong?!

11
00:01:32,013 --> 00:01:33,389
Why is he always following me?!

12
00:01:33,806 --> 00:01:36,225
How close is he to Ysa and
to my other personalities?!

13
00:01:36,559 --> 00:01:37,810
So that’s what you want, huh?

14
00:01:38,311 --> 00:01:39,854
You just won’t stop. Fine...

15
00:01:40,438 --> 00:01:42,032
I’ll give you exactly what you want.

16
00:01:42,815 --> 00:01:44,776
I just want to say thank you...

17
00:01:45,693 --> 00:01:47,111
for everything you've done.

18
00:01:47,695 --> 00:01:49,072
They’ve already
told me everything.

19
00:01:50,073 --> 00:01:51,115
Alright,

20
00:01:51,115 --> 00:01:52,158
I’ll let you have your way.

21
00:01:53,034 --> 00:01:54,285
Just do the same for me.

22
00:01:55,453 --> 00:01:56,324
With what?

23
00:01:58,122 --> 00:01:58,956
A date.

24
00:01:58,956 --> 00:02:00,333
I'm glad we came back.

25
00:02:00,416 --> 00:02:01,376
Belle?

26
00:02:03,169 --> 00:02:04,003
Estong!

27
00:03:18,327 --> 00:03:19,343
Estong.

28
00:03:20,455 --> 00:03:21,609
What are you doing here?

29
00:03:24,167 --> 00:03:25,304
Shouldn't I...

30
00:03:25,516 --> 00:03:27,796
be the one asking that?

31
00:03:30,673 --> 00:03:32,341
Belle, we have a date tonight.

32
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:34,757
Ahhh!

33
00:03:35,219 --> 00:03:36,554
Ah, is that tonight?

34
00:03:37,013 --> 00:03:40,016
Oh, I didn't know our
friendly date was tonight.

35
00:03:41,017 --> 00:03:41,960
Belle...

36
00:03:42,310 --> 00:03:45,229
we were clear about
the day and time, right?

37
00:03:46,689 --> 00:03:47,648
Oh...

38
00:03:48,149 --> 00:03:49,984
Maybe I didn't quite understand.

39
00:03:51,194 --> 00:03:53,613
Sorry, I must've misunderstood.

40
00:03:55,406 --> 00:03:56,866
Belle, everything okay?

41
00:03:57,492 --> 00:03:58,201
Yeah,

42
00:03:58,201 --> 00:03:59,635
Maybe there was

43
00:03:59,714 --> 00:04:03,426
just a bit of a miscommunication
about our friendly date.

44
00:04:03,831 --> 00:04:05,958
Ah! Lorenz, this is Estong.

45
00:04:13,382 --> 00:04:14,429
I know you, bro.

46
00:04:15,134 --> 00:04:15,874
Huh?

47
00:04:16,427 --> 00:04:18,095
I saw you in Belle's posts.

48
00:04:19,138 --> 00:04:20,348
Estong, let's take a selfie.

49
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:21,557
I'm gonna post you on my story.

50
00:04:21,557 --> 00:04:23,643
Wow! Look at you!

51
00:04:23,643 --> 00:04:25,144
Let's take a picture. I'll send it to him.

52
00:04:25,394 --> 00:04:26,813
Smile!

53
00:04:29,190 --> 00:04:30,483
I even thought you were her boyfriend.

54
00:04:31,025 --> 00:04:31,906
Huh?

55
00:04:32,902 --> 00:04:33,778
Oh, no!

56
00:04:33,778 --> 00:04:34,612
No! No! No!

57
00:04:34,612 --> 00:04:36,447
No, no. Definitely not.

58
00:04:36,814 --> 00:04:38,608
He's just my friend!

59
00:04:42,119 --> 00:04:43,093
What's up, bro?

60
00:04:44,038 --> 00:04:45,265
I know you too, bro.

61
00:04:47,875 --> 00:04:49,085
I know you very well.

62
00:04:50,336 --> 00:04:51,171
Estong.

63
00:04:56,342 --> 00:04:57,552
What do you mean you know me?

64
00:04:59,428 --> 00:05:00,680
So, it was you?

65
00:05:01,222 --> 00:05:02,807
You're the one who gave up on her.

66
00:05:03,224 --> 00:05:06,060
You're the reason why Belle
became afraid of herself.

67
00:05:06,269 --> 00:05:07,520
And now, you're back?

68
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:11,848
Bro.

69
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:16,200
Bro.

70
00:05:22,952 --> 00:05:23,778
Estong...

71
00:05:25,037 --> 00:05:26,114
aren't you going home yet?

72
00:05:29,292 --> 00:05:30,137
That's what I said.

73
00:05:31,043 --> 00:05:32,128
Alright, have a seat.

74
00:05:32,128 --> 00:05:32,950
Here.

75
00:05:33,254 --> 00:05:34,973
Here you go, bro. Sit here.

76
00:05:35,256 --> 00:05:36,512
Maybe the seat isn't near enough.

77
00:05:38,634 --> 00:05:39,489
Enjoy!

78
00:05:40,052 --> 00:05:41,036
The water's good.

79
00:05:43,306 --> 00:05:44,599
Ooh! So excited!

80
00:05:50,646 --> 00:05:51,939
You're just friends.

81
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:54,150
You have no right to be jealous.

82
00:05:54,567 --> 00:05:57,361
If she's happy, you should be too.

83
00:05:58,362 --> 00:05:59,655
But why him again?

84
00:05:59,655 --> 00:06:01,490
- Why Lorenz?
- Excuse me, waiter.

85
00:06:02,074 --> 00:06:04,285
Does he know the truth about you, Belle?

86
00:06:21,928 --> 00:06:22,887
Loves...

87
00:06:23,512 --> 00:06:24,680
that can wait, okay?

88
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:26,390
Come on, just give me a kiss.

89
00:06:26,390 --> 00:06:28,893
- Hey, let me finish this first. Later, okay?
- Come on, I can't resist you. Just for a while, please.

90
00:06:28,893 --> 00:06:30,311
- Come on. Just for a bit.
- Can't that wait for later?

91
00:06:30,311 --> 00:06:31,520
Come on, just a second.

92
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,480
Ugh, you're so stubborn.

93
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,731
Come on, just give me a kiss.

94
00:06:34,523 --> 00:06:35,479
I'm excited.

95
00:06:39,403 --> 00:06:40,196
Lorenz?

96
00:06:41,489 --> 00:06:42,239
Nang, Nong.

97
00:06:43,908 --> 00:06:44,825
Good evening,

98
00:06:45,242 --> 00:06:46,452
I'm Lorenz.

99
00:06:48,537 --> 00:06:49,430
Ah...

100
00:06:49,455 --> 00:06:50,473
Ah.

101
00:06:50,498 --> 00:06:51,040
Hello.

102
00:06:51,582 --> 00:06:52,667
Um, welcome to our house.

103
00:06:52,667 --> 00:06:53,684
Thank you.

104
00:06:53,709 --> 00:06:54,543
Lorenz,

105
00:06:54,669 --> 00:06:56,073
I'll go straight to the point.

106
00:06:56,379 --> 00:06:58,130
Do you know about Belle's condition?

107
00:06:58,547 --> 00:06:59,590
Uh...ye—

108
00:06:59,924 --> 00:07:00,650
Oh,

109
00:07:00,675 --> 00:07:02,315
I already told him everything, Nang.

110
00:07:02,718 --> 00:07:03,819
Everything?

111
00:07:03,844 --> 00:07:04,762
Mhm! Everything.

112
00:07:05,096 --> 00:07:06,931
About my D.I.D., my condition,

113
00:07:06,931 --> 00:07:08,975
my personalities, everything that happened…

114
00:07:08,975 --> 00:07:09,892
Everything.

115
00:07:10,017 --> 00:07:10,977
But sweetheart,

116
00:07:11,102 --> 00:07:12,395
he left you!

117
00:07:12,853 --> 00:07:13,980
Are you sure about him?!

118
00:07:14,355 --> 00:07:15,164
And you,

119
00:07:15,189 --> 00:07:16,307
didn't you get scared?

120
00:07:17,108 --> 00:07:17,984
No, No.

121
00:07:18,150 --> 00:07:19,735
I still see Belle the same way.

122
00:07:20,027 --> 00:07:21,487
Regardless of which
personality comes out.

123
00:07:21,487 --> 00:07:23,864
- Hey, hey, hey.
- Then why are you only showing up now?

124
00:07:24,115 --> 00:07:26,701
After your first date,
you never showed up again.

125
00:07:27,410 --> 00:07:28,035
Nang,

126
00:07:28,035 --> 00:07:29,745
what matters is that

127
00:07:29,745 --> 00:07:30,955
Lorenz is back.

128
00:07:30,955 --> 00:07:33,416
He’s here and we’re okay now.

129
00:07:34,054 --> 00:07:34,917
Belle.

130
00:07:35,501 --> 00:07:36,456
Let's sit?

131
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:44,510
And besides...

132
00:07:45,594 --> 00:07:46,971
I still want to get to know Belle

133
00:07:47,388 --> 00:07:48,409
and study her better.

134
00:07:50,057 --> 00:07:51,128
Study her?

135
00:07:52,476 --> 00:07:53,698
"Study her," huh?

136
00:07:54,061 --> 00:07:55,855
What do you think she is,
a science project?

137
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:57,245
It seems like you want to pick her apart.

138
00:07:57,565 --> 00:07:58,659
Uh, no, no.

139
00:07:58,774 --> 00:07:59,750
I mean...

140
00:07:59,775 --> 00:08:01,736
to understand her better,
especially with her disorder.

141
00:08:02,445 --> 00:08:03,904
I got too busy back then.

142
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,182
And I know, I hurt her.

143
00:08:06,741 --> 00:08:08,617
Maybe I gave her the wrong signals.

144
00:08:09,326 --> 00:08:10,472
Maybe she thought

145
00:08:10,828 --> 00:08:12,038
I gave up on her too easily.

146
00:08:13,330 --> 00:08:14,315
That's why...

147
00:08:15,374 --> 00:08:16,584
I want to make it up to her.

148
00:08:20,463 --> 00:08:21,672
Oh, I see.

149
00:08:30,014 --> 00:08:32,516
You're making good progress, Ysabelle.

150
00:08:32,933 --> 00:08:34,894
You can control your emotions now.

151
00:08:36,353 --> 00:08:38,606
So what now, Doc?
Congrats to me or something?

152
00:08:39,190 --> 00:08:40,323
Do I get a star?

153
00:08:40,441 --> 00:08:42,284
You've been a star for a long time,

154
00:08:42,526 --> 00:08:44,653
because you've been shining ever since,

155
00:08:44,945 --> 00:08:46,155
and you're so colorful.

156
00:08:46,655 --> 00:08:48,365
That's why I’m glad,

157
00:08:48,616 --> 00:08:49,425
because...

158
00:08:49,450 --> 00:08:52,119
you’re embracing everything
you’re feeling right now.

159
00:08:52,453 --> 00:08:54,163
You're embracing everything
that brings you happiness

160
00:08:54,163 --> 00:08:55,956
and pain,

161
00:08:56,373 --> 00:08:59,126
especially when it comes to your love life.

162
00:09:03,005 --> 00:09:03,672
What is this?

163
00:09:03,672 --> 00:09:05,883
Do you also need to know
about my love life, Doc?

164
00:09:05,883 --> 00:09:06,467
Ah...

165
00:09:07,051 --> 00:09:08,761
That’s okay, Belle.

166
00:09:08,761 --> 00:09:11,931
I also need to know
your parents' observations.

167
00:09:12,098 --> 00:09:14,725
So we can understand
your condition as a whole.

168
00:09:15,017 --> 00:09:16,310
And I'm glad that...

169
00:09:16,519 --> 00:09:17,853
you've been so positive

170
00:09:18,395 --> 00:09:20,773
about Lorenz coming back.

171
00:09:22,525 --> 00:09:24,443
Privacy is overrated here.

172
00:09:28,447 --> 00:09:29,532
But Ysabelle,

173
00:09:29,657 --> 00:09:31,784
that doesn’t mean you’re okay now, alright?

174
00:09:31,909 --> 00:09:33,244
Because there’s still a chance

175
00:09:33,410 --> 00:09:35,079
you might get overwhelmed, okay?

176
00:09:35,579 --> 00:09:38,582
Hmm, like you said, Doc.
Breathe in, breathe out,

177
00:09:38,582 --> 00:09:39,542
just stay calm.

178
00:09:39,542 --> 00:09:42,211
- Don't be happy—
- I never said, "Don’t be happy."

179
00:09:42,211 --> 00:09:43,212
Oh, then I'll just keep it subtle.

180
00:09:43,212 --> 00:09:43,921
No.

181
00:09:44,296 --> 00:09:45,089
Balance.

182
00:09:45,506 --> 00:09:47,299
It's called balance.

183
00:09:47,550 --> 00:09:48,259
And also,

184
00:09:48,259 --> 00:09:50,970
if one of your personalities comes out...

185
00:09:51,345 --> 00:09:53,722
you need to learn to accept it, embrace it,

186
00:09:53,889 --> 00:09:54,473
okay?

187
00:09:54,473 --> 00:09:56,934
How many times do I have to tell you?
I don't need them.

188
00:09:57,309 --> 00:09:59,270
How many times have I also told you—

189
00:09:59,603 --> 00:10:02,481
these personalities are
not different from you,

190
00:10:02,481 --> 00:10:04,191
they're a part of you.

191
00:10:04,608 --> 00:10:06,402
You can’t lock them away / hide them /

192
00:10:06,402 --> 00:10:08,821
or erase them from your life.

193
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:11,490
You need to learn how to coexist

194
00:10:11,740 --> 00:10:13,242
with these personalities.

195
00:10:13,450 --> 00:10:15,911
Because they're a part of you,
right? Okay?

196
00:10:17,246 --> 00:10:18,747
Gosh, this is so exhausting.

197
00:10:19,999 --> 00:10:21,500
Oh, but that's just how it is,

198
00:10:21,709 --> 00:10:22,376
okay?

199
00:10:22,376 --> 00:10:23,127
[phone pings]

200
00:10:25,421 --> 00:10:26,922
[Text Message]
Lorenz: I'm outside.

201
00:10:26,922 --> 00:10:28,007
Lorenz is here.

202
00:10:28,340 --> 00:10:29,175
Doc, I'll get going now, okay?

203
00:10:30,593 --> 00:10:31,552
Alright, take care!

204
00:10:34,555 --> 00:10:35,639
Nanang, Nonong, I'll be leaving now.

205
00:10:35,973 --> 00:10:37,516
Bye! Take care, okay?

206
00:10:38,225 --> 00:10:39,213
Bye, sweetheart.

207
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:46,417
Ah! I'll go ahead now.

208
00:10:46,442 --> 00:10:47,568
Doc, just a moment.

209
00:10:47,568 --> 00:10:48,604
Oh, okay.

210
00:10:49,236 --> 00:10:49,962
Doc,

211
00:10:49,987 --> 00:10:51,447
are you sure

212
00:10:51,447 --> 00:10:53,407
this won’t be bad for Belle?

213
00:10:54,116 --> 00:10:56,243
It's Lorenz. You already know...

214
00:10:56,243 --> 00:10:56,911
they have...

215
00:10:56,911 --> 00:10:58,621
- they have a history, right?
- Yes.

216
00:10:58,621 --> 00:11:00,289
I know, Barbs, Kent.

217
00:11:00,289 --> 00:11:01,040
Honestly...

218
00:11:01,582 --> 00:11:04,627
I'm worried because we know that Lorenz
is her trigger.

219
00:11:04,919 --> 00:11:05,503
But...

220
00:11:06,170 --> 00:11:08,255
Belle won't feel it right now

221
00:11:08,255 --> 00:11:09,757
because she's happy, for now.

222
00:11:09,965 --> 00:11:12,718
You know, when trauma isn’t processed,

223
00:11:13,385 --> 00:11:14,845
it can really become a trigger.

224
00:11:15,596 --> 00:11:17,139
Exactly, Doc. So what if...

225
00:11:17,139 --> 00:11:18,849
Lorenz hurts her again?

226
00:11:18,974 --> 00:11:21,352
Well, that’s what we need
to watch out for, right?

227
00:11:21,685 --> 00:11:23,187
It has gotten better now,

228
00:11:23,187 --> 00:11:24,563
because at least her
emotions are more positive,

229
00:11:24,563 --> 00:11:26,690
as compared to all the negativity

230
00:11:26,690 --> 00:11:28,108
she'd been carrying for so long.

231
00:11:28,484 --> 00:11:30,319
We just need to trust Ysabelle

232
00:11:30,444 --> 00:11:31,237
for now...

233
00:11:31,570 --> 00:11:34,156
that she can protect herself.

234
00:11:39,119 --> 00:11:39,995
Thank you, Doc.

235
00:11:49,713 --> 00:11:50,297
Belle.

236
00:11:51,966 --> 00:11:52,675
About your...

237
00:11:52,967 --> 00:11:54,051
About your D.I.D...

238
00:11:56,095 --> 00:11:58,889
Why did you tell your parents
that you already told me everything?

239
00:12:00,266 --> 00:12:01,350
But the truth is...

240
00:12:01,809 --> 00:12:03,978
you don't want to talk
about the other details.

241
00:12:04,770 --> 00:12:05,980
That's okay, Lorenz.

242
00:12:07,629 --> 00:12:09,298
I just don't want them

243
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:10,776
to have any doubts about you.

244
00:12:11,527 --> 00:12:13,779
Besides, there’s nothing interesting about
my condition anyway.

245
00:12:14,029 --> 00:12:15,030
I don’t want to talk about it.

246
00:12:16,073 --> 00:12:16,949
Delivery!

247
00:12:18,993 --> 00:12:20,286
Ah, thank you. Just put it there.

248
00:12:20,703 --> 00:12:21,245
Thanks.

249
00:12:22,830 --> 00:12:23,497
Hi, Estong.

250
00:12:24,331 --> 00:12:24,748
Hi.

251
00:12:26,125 --> 00:12:26,625
Hey.

252
00:12:28,752 --> 00:12:29,670
As I was saying...

253
00:12:31,297 --> 00:12:32,187
what if...

254
00:12:32,881 --> 00:12:34,008
I want to know everything now.

255
00:12:36,802 --> 00:12:37,886
What do you mean?

256
00:12:40,514 --> 00:12:41,336
Belle...

257
00:12:41,765 --> 00:12:44,059
I’d like to feature you
on our magazine show.

258
00:12:44,768 --> 00:12:45,869
Have you watched

259
00:12:45,894 --> 00:12:46,804
K.K.K.?

260
00:12:47,021 --> 00:12:48,731
Your unique story, send it to K.K.K.!

261
00:12:49,732 --> 00:12:50,624
- Hold on.
- No?

262
00:12:50,649 --> 00:12:51,859
Wait, bro, wait.

263
00:12:52,568 --> 00:12:53,460
What is this?

264
00:12:53,485 --> 00:12:56,280
Are you going to turn Belle’s
condition into a circus?

265
00:12:56,530 --> 00:12:57,679
For your show?

266
00:12:57,823 --> 00:12:58,757
Bro,

267
00:12:58,782 --> 00:12:59,867
it's called awareness.

268
00:13:00,617 --> 00:13:04,121
This could really help the public better
understand D.I.D.

269
00:13:04,580 --> 00:13:05,956
Awareness or ratings?

270
00:13:07,499 --> 00:13:08,711
Belle, don't agree to this.

271
00:13:08,959 --> 00:13:11,882
You can't just allow anyone
to film you for clout.

272
00:13:12,838 --> 00:13:13,589
Estong, can you not?

273
00:13:13,589 --> 00:13:15,507
I can make my own decisions.

274
00:13:21,013 --> 00:13:22,226
Okay, I'll do it.

275
00:13:22,765 --> 00:13:23,711
- See?
- Belle.

276
00:13:24,391 --> 00:13:25,804
Belle herself agreed to it.

277
00:13:25,934 --> 00:13:26,656
Belle.

278
00:13:29,563 --> 00:13:30,757
Here's the contract.

279
00:13:31,565 --> 00:13:32,900
You need to sign this.

280
00:13:40,115 --> 00:13:40,671
Belle?

281
00:13:41,658 --> 00:13:44,661
OMG! Am I gonna be famous already?!

282
00:13:44,661 --> 00:13:47,373
Hashtag, road to stardom!

283
00:13:47,373 --> 00:13:48,586
I love it!

284
00:13:48,707 --> 00:13:50,292
Are you gonna be my director?

285
00:13:50,292 --> 00:13:52,002
I have to look pretty all the time.

286
00:13:52,002 --> 00:13:53,587
I have to be fabulous, okay?

287
00:13:53,587 --> 00:13:55,464
When do we start?

288
00:13:55,464 --> 00:13:57,174
Clock it!

289
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:03,722
Uh.

290
00:14:03,722 --> 00:14:05,273
Belle, Belle, Belle, are you okay?

291
00:14:05,766 --> 00:14:06,812
Bro, hold on.

292
00:14:06,934 --> 00:14:08,243
Belle's not ready yet.

293
00:14:08,268 --> 00:14:10,187
So take it easy with that camera of yours.

294
00:14:11,688 --> 00:14:12,625
Belle?

295
00:14:13,023 --> 00:14:14,191
Do I need to...

296
00:14:15,484 --> 00:14:16,443
sign that?

297
00:14:16,985 --> 00:14:18,320
Isn’t it enough

298
00:14:18,487 --> 00:14:19,546
that I agreed?

299
00:14:19,863 --> 00:14:22,241
You need to sign this for legal purposes.

300
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:24,218
But…

301
00:14:24,243 --> 00:14:25,619
okay, maybe another day.

302
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:27,579
Maybe we should just forget it?

303
00:14:29,289 --> 00:14:30,707
So it won’t be complicated.

304
00:14:32,167 --> 00:14:33,961
[phone ringing]

305
00:14:35,712 --> 00:14:36,964
Ah! Sorry, someone’s calling.

306
00:14:38,090 --> 00:14:38,929
Hello?

307
00:14:39,591 --> 00:14:40,515
Uh, yeah.

308
00:14:45,722 --> 00:14:46,562
What?

309
00:14:46,890 --> 00:14:48,225
What are you smiling at?

310
00:14:49,184 --> 00:14:50,265
I'm proud of you

311
00:14:50,561 --> 00:14:52,062
because you didn’t go
through with the contract.

312
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:53,939
What does that have to do with you?

313
00:14:55,441 --> 00:14:56,296
Well...

314
00:14:56,650 --> 00:14:57,586
for you,

315
00:14:57,901 --> 00:14:58,875
for all of you.

316
00:15:00,028 --> 00:15:01,488
You're protecting them

317
00:15:02,197 --> 00:15:04,074
because you're a good person.

318
00:15:05,909 --> 00:15:08,328
I'm not protecting anyone.

319
00:15:10,914 --> 00:15:12,166
And I'm not a good person.

320
00:15:13,041 --> 00:15:14,046
You're good...

321
00:15:14,501 --> 00:15:15,570
You're a good person...

322
00:15:15,794 --> 00:15:16,976
smart.

323
00:15:17,713 --> 00:15:18,797
Everything. You have it all.

324
00:15:20,507 --> 00:15:22,009
Don’t you see that

325
00:15:22,718 --> 00:15:23,969
there are so many people around you?

326
00:15:24,928 --> 00:15:26,263
Not one of them left.

327
00:15:30,726 --> 00:15:32,186
Because you're easy to love, Belle.

328
00:15:38,192 --> 00:15:38,984
Belle?

329
00:15:39,526 --> 00:15:40,718
Belle, are you okay?

330
00:15:40,777 --> 00:15:41,726
Belle!

331
00:15:41,945 --> 00:15:43,218
I'll call for help.

332
00:15:47,409 --> 00:15:48,869
Estong, it’s okay. I’m fine.

333
00:15:52,206 --> 00:15:53,156
Ysa?

334
00:15:55,083 --> 00:15:55,875
Mhm.

335
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:58,086
Ysa, is that you?!

336
00:15:58,754 --> 00:15:59,554
Mhm.

337
00:16:05,769 --> 00:16:06,679
Ysa.

338
00:16:08,180 --> 00:16:10,125
I thought I’d never
get to talk to you again.

339
00:16:10,641 --> 00:16:11,914
I missed you so much.

340
00:16:15,020 --> 00:16:16,438
Now that you've met Belle,

341
00:16:17,397 --> 00:16:18,211
how was it?

342
00:16:22,069 --> 00:16:22,992
Well...

343
00:16:23,741 --> 00:16:24,757
she's mean.

344
00:16:26,198 --> 00:16:27,282
I’ve been doing everything I could.

345
00:16:27,282 --> 00:16:30,827
I tried to trigger her so you’d come back.

346
00:16:31,370 --> 00:16:32,367
Hey,

347
00:16:32,496 --> 00:16:33,997
you shouldn’t be doing that.

348
00:16:34,581 --> 00:16:35,586
Don't, okay?

349
00:16:40,963 --> 00:16:42,881
Do you still remember
our last conversation?

350
00:16:44,925 --> 00:16:45,734
Yes.

351
00:16:46,718 --> 00:16:47,500
Ysa.

352
00:16:47,636 --> 00:16:48,500
Hmm?

353
00:16:49,137 --> 00:16:50,250
I really love you.

354
00:16:54,970 --> 00:16:56,638
Estong, I'm sorry.

355
00:16:57,556 --> 00:16:59,436
I didn't tell you the truth right away.

356
00:17:01,024 --> 00:17:02,943
That I'm just one of...

357
00:17:05,904 --> 00:17:07,781
Belle's personalities, that's why...

358
00:17:09,199 --> 00:17:10,576
we can't be together.

359
00:17:12,536 --> 00:17:14,621
You have nothing to be sorry for, Ysa.

360
00:17:16,623 --> 00:17:18,083
I understand your reason.

361
00:17:19,293 --> 00:17:21,211
You had to do that for Belle,

362
00:17:22,004 --> 00:17:23,054
and for all of you.

363
00:17:24,923 --> 00:17:25,882
I know

364
00:17:26,633 --> 00:17:27,968
you didn’t want to hurt me either.

365
00:17:29,094 --> 00:17:30,031
Even so,

366
00:17:30,596 --> 00:17:32,306
I know I still hurt you.

367
00:17:34,141 --> 00:17:35,000
It hurt.

368
00:17:35,892 --> 00:17:37,311
But, it's okay.

369
00:17:38,353 --> 00:17:39,146
It's okay now.

370
00:17:43,442 --> 00:17:44,276
Just...

371
00:17:46,111 --> 00:17:47,571
always listen to this.

372
00:17:49,072 --> 00:17:52,117
No matter how complicated Belle may be…

373
00:17:54,786 --> 00:17:58,582
I’m sure her true feelings for you will
always come through.

374
00:18:02,252 --> 00:18:03,086
I know.

375
00:18:04,921 --> 00:18:06,715
I know because we're one.

376
00:18:19,666 --> 00:18:20,412
Estong.

377
00:18:20,437 --> 00:18:21,330
Oh.

378
00:18:21,355 --> 00:18:22,185
Belle.

379
00:18:23,774 --> 00:18:24,919
Why are you still here?

380
00:18:25,651 --> 00:18:26,860
Aren’t you leaving yet?

381
00:18:27,402 --> 00:18:28,737
Lorenz and I are fine here.

382
00:18:29,946 --> 00:18:31,576
Uh, okay. I'm leaving.

383
00:18:36,787 --> 00:18:39,081
Don’t worry, I can do this.

384
00:18:39,081 --> 00:18:41,458
Besides, I already shot a few
videos of her earlier.

385
00:18:41,875 --> 00:18:42,918
Is that everything?

386
00:18:43,168 --> 00:18:45,003
If that’s everything,
transfer it right away!

387
00:18:45,295 --> 00:18:46,254
Yes, Ms. Valdez.

388
00:18:47,089 --> 00:18:48,832
When we feature this on our show,

389
00:18:49,424 --> 00:18:51,238
I’m sure the ratings will be high.

390
00:18:51,927 --> 00:18:53,111
Good.

391
00:18:53,136 --> 00:18:55,847
I’ll have it lined up on
the programming calendar.

392
00:18:56,264 --> 00:18:58,225
When can I expect to see the footage?

393
00:18:58,725 --> 00:18:59,893
Yes, ma'am.

394
00:18:59,893 --> 00:19:00,699
As soon...

395
00:19:00,724 --> 00:19:02,707
as soon as she signs the contract.

396
00:19:03,271 --> 00:19:04,439
We need it ASAP.

397
00:19:04,940 --> 00:19:07,734
Lorenz, you know your
contract is almost up.

398
00:19:08,235 --> 00:19:11,738
You need to deliver something
strong to get it renewed.

399
00:19:13,031 --> 00:19:13,932
I know.

400
00:19:14,574 --> 00:19:15,689
I know, Ms. Valdez.

401
00:19:20,998 --> 00:19:21,924
So...

402
00:19:22,666 --> 00:19:25,043
you’re really just going to use Belle for
your career, huh?

403
00:19:26,461 --> 00:19:27,104
What,

404
00:19:27,129 --> 00:19:28,313
are you going to deny it?

405
00:19:28,338 --> 00:19:29,752
I heard everything, bro.

406
00:19:32,509 --> 00:19:33,719
This isn't just for me.

407
00:19:34,636 --> 00:19:35,830
This is also for her.

408
00:19:36,221 --> 00:19:37,932
And what's the issue if she agreed to it?

409
00:19:38,932 --> 00:19:40,127
What do you mean it's for her?

410
00:19:40,517 --> 00:19:41,727
Did you see how it affected her

411
00:19:41,727 --> 00:19:43,311
when you pointed your lens at her?

412
00:19:43,603 --> 00:19:44,813
You might trigger her even more!

413
00:19:44,813 --> 00:19:45,846
Trigger?

414
00:19:45,897 --> 00:19:46,940
I'm Belle's friend.

415
00:19:47,649 --> 00:19:49,234
My friendship with her is genuine,

416
00:19:49,319 --> 00:19:50,570
so I won’t let anyone…

417
00:19:51,194 --> 00:19:52,654
use her.

418
00:19:53,697 --> 00:19:54,822
Especially you.

419
00:19:55,532 --> 00:19:56,635
So check yourself.

420
00:20:00,954 --> 00:20:01,799
Hey.

421
00:20:03,081 --> 00:20:04,166
- Belle.
- Belle.

422
00:20:04,416 --> 00:20:05,375
Are you guys okay?

423
00:20:06,251 --> 00:20:07,335
Yeah, yeah, yeah. We're good.

424
00:20:07,919 --> 00:20:09,129
Estong and I were just talking.

425
00:20:09,546 --> 00:20:10,714
Uh, right.

426
00:20:14,468 --> 00:20:15,424
That's right.

427
00:20:15,886 --> 00:20:16,924
Are you guys sure?

428
00:20:17,179 --> 00:20:18,603
You two seem pretty close.

429
00:20:20,265 --> 00:20:22,809
I just asked him what his secret is because
his teeth are so white.

430
00:20:23,977 --> 00:20:26,135
I don’t know why he can’t
apply that to his conscience.

431
00:20:26,813 --> 00:20:27,647
Huh? What?

432
00:20:27,647 --> 00:20:28,106
His con...

433
00:20:28,106 --> 00:20:29,858
Uh, um...con...

434
00:20:30,275 --> 00:20:31,557
Good thing you're okay now.

435
00:20:32,527 --> 00:20:33,295
Ah,

436
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:34,353
of course.

437
00:20:34,446 --> 00:20:35,182
Yeah.

438
00:20:35,530 --> 00:20:36,865
I told you, didn't I?

439
00:20:37,824 --> 00:20:38,697
I can handle this.

440
00:20:43,121 --> 00:20:43,889
Alright.

441
00:20:43,914 --> 00:20:44,869
I'll go now.

442
00:20:45,332 --> 00:20:46,666
They're already looking
for me at the shop.

443
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:01,689
Kuya...

444
00:21:02,307 --> 00:21:04,471
If you're sure about what you heard...

445
00:21:05,018 --> 00:21:07,829
then why don’t you tell Ate Belle already?

446
00:21:07,854 --> 00:21:08,760
So

447
00:21:08,939 --> 00:21:10,189
she can avoid him.

448
00:21:13,652 --> 00:21:14,643
I can’t, bro.

449
00:21:15,737 --> 00:21:16,738
She’ll get hurt.

450
00:21:17,864 --> 00:21:19,491
She might hurt herself again,

451
00:21:19,491 --> 00:21:20,447
and not just that…

452
00:21:21,284 --> 00:21:23,036
Ysa might not be the only
one who comes out.

453
00:21:23,995 --> 00:21:25,914
What if another personality comes out?

454
00:21:27,457 --> 00:21:28,166
Then...

455
00:21:28,333 --> 00:21:29,960
warn Tita Barbs and the others.

456
00:21:30,293 --> 00:21:31,586
Or tell Adel,

457
00:21:31,586 --> 00:21:33,463
so he can’t get near her, right?

458
00:21:34,130 --> 00:21:34,965
Or

459
00:21:35,215 --> 00:21:37,092
you could just point me to Lorenz, right?

460
00:21:37,217 --> 00:21:39,010
I’ll deal with him myself. Okay?

461
00:21:39,010 --> 00:21:40,011
He won’t show up again.

462
00:21:44,599 --> 00:21:45,559
That's my coffee.

463
00:21:46,351 --> 00:21:48,603
And your suggestions are terrible.

464
00:21:49,020 --> 00:21:51,022
What? Do you want to be a famous criminal?

465
00:21:51,481 --> 00:21:52,482
Of course not, Pops.

466
00:21:52,858 --> 00:21:55,360
Can't I just be Ate Belle's handsome hero?

467
00:21:55,986 --> 00:21:57,070
Can you stop?

468
00:21:57,195 --> 00:21:58,530
You're not helping.

469
00:21:58,530 --> 00:21:59,990
Go clean the kitchen.

470
00:21:59,990 --> 00:22:02,325
I need to talk to your brother properly.

471
00:22:08,832 --> 00:22:10,500
That idiot even drank my coffee.

472
00:22:13,753 --> 00:22:14,732
Uh...

473
00:22:15,755 --> 00:22:16,298
Son.

474
00:22:16,298 --> 00:22:17,048
Pops.

475
00:22:18,174 --> 00:22:19,216
Be honest...

476
00:22:20,135 --> 00:22:21,326
You're jealous?

477
00:22:22,095 --> 00:22:23,154
Oh, come on, Pops!

478
00:22:23,179 --> 00:22:25,490
You're even harder to talk to than Jayden.

479
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:26,725
Oh, stop.

480
00:22:26,725 --> 00:22:28,318
I know you. You're my son.

481
00:22:32,105 --> 00:22:32,689
Yes,

482
00:22:33,398 --> 00:22:34,524
I'll admit it, Pops.

483
00:22:35,275 --> 00:22:36,359
I'm jealous.

484
00:22:37,319 --> 00:22:38,278
I'm scared.

485
00:22:40,322 --> 00:22:41,781
I'm scared of hurting Belle

486
00:22:41,781 --> 00:22:44,826
when she finds out
Lorenz's true intentions.

487
00:22:47,245 --> 00:22:48,079
Oh, then...

488
00:22:49,456 --> 00:22:50,540
that's what you need to admit.

489
00:22:51,875 --> 00:22:52,965
What, Pops?

490
00:22:53,627 --> 00:22:55,128
Be straight with Belle.

491
00:22:55,462 --> 00:22:57,172
Tell her you’re jealous

492
00:22:57,172 --> 00:22:59,132
and you’re worried

493
00:22:59,549 --> 00:23:01,343
she’ll just end up with Lorenz.

494
00:23:03,970 --> 00:23:05,027
But, Pops...

495
00:23:06,222 --> 00:23:07,641
I saw how happy

496
00:23:08,266 --> 00:23:10,101
Belle was with Lorenz.

497
00:23:10,769 --> 00:23:13,480
If you’d only seen how she
pushed me away earlier.

498
00:23:14,314 --> 00:23:15,941
I really stood no chance.

499
00:23:17,442 --> 00:23:18,693
That's not true, son.

500
00:23:19,319 --> 00:23:20,195
You do stand a chance,

501
00:23:21,529 --> 00:23:23,865
because what you feel is real.

502
00:23:25,033 --> 00:23:26,618
Your love for her...

503
00:23:27,035 --> 00:23:28,370
that's her protection.

504
00:23:29,245 --> 00:23:30,080
That's why...

505
00:23:30,330 --> 00:23:31,414
don't give up

506
00:23:31,831 --> 00:23:33,249
if you think

507
00:23:33,249 --> 00:23:35,126
Lorenz is just using her.

508
00:23:40,256 --> 00:23:40,840
Kuya.

509
00:23:41,258 --> 00:23:42,133
Kuya, look at this

510
00:23:42,342 --> 00:23:42,842
What?

511
00:23:43,677 --> 00:23:44,844
Adel messaged me.

512
00:23:45,095 --> 00:23:47,514
She said Lorenz is going
to serenade Ate Belle.

513
00:23:47,514 --> 00:23:48,098
Huh?

514
00:23:50,183 --> 00:23:50,809
Pops...

515
00:23:51,393 --> 00:23:52,602
bring out the sound system.

516
00:23:53,228 --> 00:23:53,812
That's right!

517
00:23:55,814 --> 00:23:56,898
Hey, wait a minute.

518
00:23:56,898 --> 00:23:58,358
Why me? I'm the father.

519
00:23:58,692 --> 00:23:59,693
You guys get it.

520
00:23:59,693 --> 00:24:00,777
And that's my coffee.

521
00:24:01,319 --> 00:24:02,487
You've been at it for a while now.

522
00:24:02,487 --> 00:24:03,947
You go get it. You're the youngest.

523
00:24:03,947 --> 00:24:04,531
Come on.

524
00:24:05,073 --> 00:24:06,032
Come on, go get it.

525
00:24:06,324 --> 00:24:07,158
Alright.

526
00:24:09,411 --> 00:24:10,266
Pops...

527
00:24:10,537 --> 00:24:11,621
we're not backing down.

528
00:24:12,747 --> 00:24:13,957
What are we going to sing?

529
00:24:14,666 --> 00:24:15,625
I'm the one who's going to serenade, Pops.

530
00:24:15,625 --> 00:24:16,793
Oh, right. You.

531
00:24:18,211 --> 00:24:20,839
Yeah, yeah, yeah...

532
00:24:21,923 --> 00:24:23,000
That's my song.

533
00:24:23,550 --> 00:24:24,398
Oh, sorry.

534
00:24:31,099 --> 00:24:32,142
Hey, how are you guys?

535
00:24:32,225 --> 00:24:33,018
What the heck?

536
00:24:33,601 --> 00:24:35,186
This guy just pops up out of nowhere.

537
00:24:35,645 --> 00:24:36,570
Belle!

538
00:24:36,604 --> 00:24:37,500
Hey!

539
00:24:38,773 --> 00:24:40,358
There's a serenade!

540
00:24:41,109 --> 00:24:42,193
This song's for you.

541
00:24:45,780 --> 00:24:46,781
Belle.

542
00:24:46,948 --> 00:24:47,949
What's happening?

543
00:24:48,408 --> 00:24:50,906
- There's a serenade!
- I also brought flowers...

544
00:24:51,911 --> 00:24:53,413
because you're as
beautiful as the flowers.

545
00:24:53,413 --> 00:24:56,207
Your suitor is so handsome, Belle!

546
00:24:56,207 --> 00:24:57,414
That's not true!

547
00:24:57,667 --> 00:24:59,252
Kuya Estong got beaten to it.

548
00:24:59,252 --> 00:25:00,754
He’s too slow!

549
00:25:02,005 --> 00:25:03,256
Please give this to Belle later.

550
00:25:03,256 --> 00:25:05,300
Wow! So sweet!

551
00:25:05,300 --> 00:25:07,010
Wow, what a surprise!

552
00:25:07,886 --> 00:25:09,262
Are you ready, boys?

553
00:25:09,554 --> 00:25:10,523
Let's do it!

554
00:25:12,057 --> 00:25:14,976
♪ I'm longing. ♪

555
00:25:16,478 --> 00:25:23,777
♪ You’re the one who makes
my heart feel light. Only you. ♪

556
00:25:24,152 --> 00:25:29,699
♪ No one else can make me feel this way. ♪

557
00:25:31,117 --> 00:25:37,749
♪ All I ever needed
was to hear your voice. ♪

558
00:25:38,041 --> 00:25:43,546
♪ To make my fears of
the world disappear. ♪

559
00:25:45,548 --> 00:25:46,508
Ahem!

560
00:25:47,258 --> 00:25:48,468
- Ahem!
- Excuse me, move over.

561
00:25:48,493 --> 00:25:49,541
Move over, move, move.

562
00:25:54,432 --> 00:25:55,391
It's Estong!

563
00:26:06,736 --> 00:26:07,587
Estong?

564
00:26:07,612 --> 00:26:08,822
What are you doing here?

565
00:26:11,074 --> 00:26:12,659
I'm here to court you, Belle.

566
00:26:15,411 --> 00:26:16,621
And I'm serious about it!

567
00:26:17,831 --> 00:26:18,828
Popsy.

568
00:26:23,002 --> 00:26:23,930
Ahem!

569
00:26:26,005 --> 00:26:29,843
♪ I am knocking... ♪

570
00:26:29,843 --> 00:26:30,969
Woah!

571
00:26:31,052 --> 00:26:33,721
♪ at your closed-off heart. ♪

572
00:26:34,281 --> 00:26:37,517
♪ Maybe you can let me in. ♪

573
00:26:37,767 --> 00:26:38,726
What time are we leaving?

574
00:26:39,310 --> 00:26:43,606
♪ - I'm waiting for you. ♪
- He's waiting for you, Ate Belle.

575
00:26:44,149 --> 00:26:46,818
♪ Do you still mean what you said— ♪

576
00:26:47,235 --> 00:26:51,698
♪ that you won't ever fall in love again. ♪

577
00:26:52,073 --> 00:26:55,577
♪ I know that you're already hurt.... ♪

578
00:26:55,577 --> 00:26:57,662
He knows that! My Kuya knows that!

579
00:26:58,997 --> 00:27:04,502
♪ I promise that it will
never happen again. ♪

580
00:27:04,502 --> 00:27:05,962
He's already making a promise!

581
00:27:05,962 --> 00:27:08,756
♪ I'm longing... ♪

582
00:27:08,756 --> 00:27:12,719
for your kiss,

583
00:27:12,719 --> 00:27:15,722
♪ And I will never leave. ♪

584
00:27:15,722 --> 00:27:16,598
Leave it to me.

585
00:27:16,598 --> 00:27:20,185
♪ Could it be just you. ♪

586
00:27:20,185 --> 00:27:23,229
♪ Oh, how so quick... ♪

587
00:27:23,229 --> 00:27:27,358
- I'll do it, I'll do it. I got this!
♪ - the time passes by... ♪

588
00:27:27,358 --> 00:27:30,820
- His voice sucks!
♪ - when we're together. ♪

589
00:27:31,112 --> 00:27:33,865
♪ I wish it would never end… ♪

590
00:27:34,741 --> 00:27:38,328
♪ You’re the one I want by my side... ♪

591
00:27:38,745 --> 00:27:41,122
♪ Oh, I’ll never get tired. ♪

592
00:27:41,122 --> 00:27:42,148
Ugh, that's awful!

593
00:27:46,628 --> 00:27:48,046
He's got backup dancers.

594
00:27:49,422 --> 00:27:50,131
Bro, bro...

595
00:27:50,131 --> 00:27:51,316
- Leave it to me.
- Okay!

596
00:27:51,341 --> 00:27:52,425
Start singing already.

597
00:27:53,301 --> 00:27:57,555
♪ - I am not like the rest... ♪
- Oh, yeah!

598
00:27:57,555 --> 00:28:02,477
♪ You're the only one I will ever love! ♪

599
00:28:02,477 --> 00:28:03,770
Listen baby!

600
00:28:03,770 --> 00:28:06,648
♪ Believe me. ♪

601
00:28:07,857 --> 00:28:11,319
♪ At first sight, I knew
you were the one. ♪

602
00:28:11,444 --> 00:28:17,367
♪ In every church,
I’d marry you. ♪

603
00:28:18,468 --> 00:28:23,389
♪ Belle, you’re unlike
anyone I’ve ever known. ♪

604
00:28:23,414 --> 00:28:26,918
- Woah! You guys heard that?
- Woah!

605
00:28:26,918 --> 00:28:28,047
That was good, right?

606
00:28:30,838 --> 00:28:31,756
Me.

607
00:28:32,423 --> 00:28:33,758
What's with you? What's happening?

608
00:28:33,758 --> 00:28:35,593
You're even enjoying this.

609
00:28:35,593 --> 00:28:37,220
It's making me giddy, okay?

610
00:28:37,720 --> 00:28:38,648
Oh, geez.

611
00:28:44,018 --> 00:28:45,078
You're all so noisy!

612
00:28:45,520 --> 00:28:47,522
You might overwhelm Belle

613
00:28:47,647 --> 00:28:48,815
and trigger the personalities!

614
00:28:48,815 --> 00:28:50,775
Well, go on! Go ahead.

615
00:28:50,775 --> 00:28:51,776
Oh, it's because of him.

616
00:28:51,776 --> 00:28:53,194
Sorry, sis.

617
00:28:58,908 --> 00:28:59,742
Belle!

618
00:29:01,452 --> 00:29:02,662
Come on, let's go.

619
00:29:03,579 --> 00:29:04,992
These flowers are for you.

620
00:29:05,081 --> 00:29:06,336
And there's another...

621
00:29:09,127 --> 00:29:10,061
Coffee!

622
00:29:10,086 --> 00:29:10,712
Coffee?

623
00:29:10,712 --> 00:29:11,421
Coffee again?

624
00:29:11,421 --> 00:29:12,880
This is our new coffee...

625
00:29:13,339 --> 00:29:15,550
"Ysabelle's Mocha Magic."

626
00:29:18,011 --> 00:29:19,679
Do you know why it's magic?!

627
00:29:19,887 --> 00:29:20,763
Why?!

628
00:29:23,433 --> 00:29:24,642
Go on, ask why! Come on.

629
00:29:24,934 --> 00:29:25,805
Ask it!

630
00:29:26,269 --> 00:29:27,976
Do you want us to stop them?

631
00:29:28,021 --> 00:29:29,647
Not like that. All together!

632
00:29:29,647 --> 00:29:31,107
- One, two, three!
- Just let them be.

633
00:29:31,107 --> 00:29:32,650
- Why?!
- There.

634
00:29:34,402 --> 00:29:35,742
Back then, I thought...

635
00:29:36,029 --> 00:29:38,323
that one cup of coffee was
all I needed to wake up.

636
00:29:39,365 --> 00:29:40,117
But...

637
00:29:41,397 --> 00:29:43,023
just one smile from you…

638
00:29:43,369 --> 00:29:45,016
my heart came alive!

639
00:29:46,622 --> 00:29:47,790
Whoo! Yeah!

640
00:29:48,708 --> 00:29:51,294
♪ I'm longing. ♪

641
00:30:20,323 --> 00:30:22,200
Hold on, you're too excited!

642
00:30:22,533 --> 00:30:23,910
Kuya, Kuya! It's Kuya!

643
00:30:23,910 --> 00:30:25,053
He's got something to show you, too!

644
00:30:25,078 --> 00:30:26,062
Hey, back off.

645
00:30:31,292 --> 00:30:32,406
Hide it already.

646
00:30:43,012 --> 00:30:44,972
They just had a little too much extra rice.

647
00:30:46,140 --> 00:30:47,203
So, Estong...

648
00:30:47,809 --> 00:30:48,810
may the best man win.

649
00:30:50,645 --> 00:30:51,594
Game, bro.

650
00:30:54,607 --> 00:30:57,485
Go ahead, fight over me.

651
00:31:13,126 --> 00:31:14,544
Come on, let's eat.

652
00:31:15,628 --> 00:31:16,879
- Let's eat!
- Come on.

653
00:31:17,422 --> 00:31:18,756
This was cooked by...

654
00:31:19,674 --> 00:31:21,008
- Can someone pass me the rice?
- Baby Loves.

655
00:31:21,217 --> 00:31:23,511
- Here, here, here.
- No, no, I've got it.

656
00:31:25,054 --> 00:31:26,221
I already handed it to her, okay?

657
00:31:26,848 --> 00:31:27,682
Rice?

658
00:31:28,224 --> 00:31:29,559
- Let go.
- No, I've got it.

659
00:31:29,851 --> 00:31:31,477
You know, it's just rice.

660
00:31:31,477 --> 00:31:32,752
I've got it, okay? I'll do it.

661
00:31:33,104 --> 00:31:34,174
Here, sweetheart.

662
00:31:34,355 --> 00:31:35,416
Thank you, Nang.

663
00:31:38,734 --> 00:31:39,963
That's delicious.

664
00:31:44,323 --> 00:31:45,940
What would be good to eat?

665
00:31:45,992 --> 00:31:48,494
- Here, this one. It's Laing, a Filipino dish.
- Here, here, this one's better.

666
00:31:48,744 --> 00:31:50,377
- I love Philippines.
- Here, some sushi.

667
00:31:51,914 --> 00:31:52,748
This one has rice already.

668
00:31:52,874 --> 00:31:54,350
This one. Philippines.

669
00:31:54,375 --> 00:31:55,416
It's a Filipino food.

670
00:31:55,460 --> 00:31:56,961
But both are good, right?

671
00:31:57,378 --> 00:31:58,713
But what about them, give them some, too.

672
00:31:58,713 --> 00:32:00,590
Oh, right. Here, have some!

673
00:32:01,090 --> 00:32:02,258
- Go ahead, have some.
- Alright, we'll have it.

674
00:32:02,258 --> 00:32:03,092
Good, right?

675
00:32:03,092 --> 00:32:05,011
- Look, he's getting a lot.
- Alright, thank you.

676
00:32:05,011 --> 00:32:07,180
- That's really good.
- Okay, okay, alright.

677
00:32:07,930 --> 00:32:08,799
Belle...

678
00:32:09,599 --> 00:32:11,392
turns out, we're gonna
have a shoot in Thailand.

679
00:32:11,976 --> 00:32:13,143
But it's not yet final.

680
00:32:18,036 --> 00:32:19,384
Hey. don't be sad.

681
00:32:19,775 --> 00:32:21,315
I'll be back soon, okay?

682
00:32:23,112 --> 00:32:24,682
Yeah, of course, I get it.

683
00:32:25,490 --> 00:32:26,699
It’s for work, after all.

684
00:32:27,074 --> 00:32:28,073
Part of the job.

685
00:32:28,743 --> 00:32:29,452
But,

686
00:32:29,452 --> 00:32:31,454
we can always travel abroad for leisure.

687
00:32:32,038 --> 00:32:33,096
That is,

688
00:32:33,164 --> 00:32:34,151
if you can.

689
00:32:34,624 --> 00:32:35,533
Mhm!

690
00:32:35,917 --> 00:32:37,126
Sure, that sounds fun!

691
00:32:39,045 --> 00:32:40,087
Going international already?

692
00:32:40,838 --> 00:32:42,173
It must feel nice, huh?

693
00:32:42,924 --> 00:32:45,343
Knowing exactly where you
want to go, right?

694
00:32:46,552 --> 00:32:47,401
Of course.

695
00:32:48,262 --> 00:32:49,401
Since I was a kid...

696
00:32:49,639 --> 00:32:51,098
I wanted to work in the media industry.

697
00:32:51,974 --> 00:32:53,684
My parents influenced me too, so

698
00:32:53,893 --> 00:32:55,182
even though it’s hard…

699
00:32:55,561 --> 00:32:57,987
exhausting, and there’s
so much pressure at work…

700
00:32:58,314 --> 00:32:59,330
I keep going.

701
00:33:00,483 --> 00:33:04,070
You know, people who discover
their passions early are really lucky.

702
00:33:04,362 --> 00:33:05,455
That's right.

703
00:33:08,574 --> 00:33:09,909
You're a good artist, Belle.

704
00:33:10,826 --> 00:33:12,703
And you’ll be absolutely
perfect for our show.

705
00:33:14,372 --> 00:33:16,207
I just want to paint, that’s all.

706
00:33:18,125 --> 00:33:19,143
And you'll be famous.

707
00:33:20,002 --> 00:33:21,754
Of course, she'll be famous
even without you.

708
00:33:23,464 --> 00:33:24,549
I mean, even...

709
00:33:24,549 --> 00:33:25,758
without us, right? Because...

710
00:33:25,758 --> 00:33:26,971
- she's got this.
- Of course.

711
00:33:27,385 --> 00:33:28,970
- My Ate is self-made.
- Yes.

712
00:33:29,208 --> 00:33:30,259
- Correct.
- Yes!

713
00:33:32,682 --> 00:33:35,088
But it’s still different when
you have someone to share your life with.

714
00:33:36,060 --> 00:33:37,401
Someone who also has direction.

715
00:33:38,062 --> 00:33:40,549
So you can grow together
as you both reach the finish line.

716
00:33:41,065 --> 00:33:42,650
Unlike some people who just...

717
00:33:43,401 --> 00:33:44,819
hang around

718
00:33:45,278 --> 00:33:46,268
while doing nothing.

719
00:33:50,741 --> 00:33:52,368
Oh, you know what? That's true.

720
00:33:53,369 --> 00:33:54,328
I realized that too.

721
00:33:54,328 --> 00:33:56,664
I used to think being alone was enough.

722
00:33:57,456 --> 00:34:00,001
But I realized it’s really different when…

723
00:34:01,168 --> 00:34:02,628
you have someone on
the same wavelength as you,

724
00:34:02,628 --> 00:34:05,006
someone to chase your dreams with.

725
00:34:08,551 --> 00:34:09,524
Well...

726
00:34:10,052 --> 00:34:10,886
How about you, Estong?

727
00:34:12,388 --> 00:34:13,347
What’s your dream?

728
00:34:22,857 --> 00:34:23,922
I don't know yet, actually.

729
00:34:25,901 --> 00:34:27,141
I haven't figured it out yet.

730
00:34:27,528 --> 00:34:29,005
But one thing's for sure—

731
00:34:29,030 --> 00:34:31,574
I don't deceive anyone,
I don't take advantage of anyone...

732
00:34:32,298 --> 00:34:33,578
and I don't use anyone.

733
00:34:36,162 --> 00:34:37,603
You know what, that's so true.

734
00:34:37,628 --> 00:34:39,380
Here, have some more rice.

735
00:34:40,166 --> 00:34:42,460
I really loved what you said.

736
00:34:43,599 --> 00:34:45,672
Mmm, that's noble, Estong.

737
00:34:45,880 --> 00:34:47,923
But you shouldn't be too relaxed.

738
00:34:48,983 --> 00:34:51,402
Because one day,

739
00:34:51,427 --> 00:34:53,137
you might not get another
chance. You’ll regret it.

740
00:34:53,304 --> 00:34:55,056
- She's right.
- That's true.

741
00:34:59,226 --> 00:35:01,352
All I know is, from what
I read in Ysa's diary...

742
00:35:01,604 --> 00:35:04,649
is that you're still unsure
about what you want in life!

743
00:35:06,192 --> 00:35:07,047
Oh my!

744
00:35:07,275 --> 00:35:08,047
Bro!

745
00:35:10,071 --> 00:35:11,039
Oh, sorry.

746
00:35:12,239 --> 00:35:13,174
Sis.

747
00:35:13,199 --> 00:35:14,116
Maybe he did it on purpose?

748
00:35:14,116 --> 00:35:15,301
No, I didn't.

749
00:35:15,326 --> 00:35:16,410
It's like you did it on purpose.

750
00:35:16,410 --> 00:35:18,954
Wait, wait. Go get some rags.

751
00:35:19,372 --> 00:35:20,581
Sorry, I choked on the water.

752
00:35:21,290 --> 00:35:22,625
You okay, Lorenz?

753
00:35:23,459 --> 00:35:24,585
It’s because of this.

754
00:35:24,585 --> 00:35:28,297
[Estong coughing]

755
00:35:28,464 --> 00:35:29,219
Sorry.

756
00:35:29,840 --> 00:35:31,063
I choked on the water.

757
00:35:31,384 --> 00:35:32,593
Hmm, attention seeker.

758
00:35:34,727 --> 00:35:35,429
Oh, can I...

759
00:35:35,429 --> 00:35:37,056
I also got wet, Belle.

760
00:35:37,765 --> 00:35:38,719
Here's some tissue.

761
00:35:43,145 --> 00:35:44,188
- Are you okay now?
- Mhm.

762
00:35:49,110 --> 00:35:51,570
- I'm rooting for Lorenz.
- Mhm.

763
00:35:52,405 --> 00:35:53,906
- He has a career...
- Right.

764
00:35:54,281 --> 00:35:56,200
- He has direction...
- Right!

765
00:35:56,617 --> 00:35:57,827
And the face card... Bam!

766
00:35:57,827 --> 00:35:58,719
Bam!

767
00:35:58,744 --> 00:36:00,413
- Bam! Ten out of ten!
- Right again!

768
00:36:00,413 --> 00:36:01,664
He's oozing with charisma!

769
00:36:01,664 --> 00:36:03,249
- Yeah, right?
- His style...

770
00:36:03,666 --> 00:36:06,419
Calm, perfect,

771
00:36:06,419 --> 00:36:08,045
smooth!

772
00:36:08,170 --> 00:36:11,132
And girl, I want to
join him on vacation!

773
00:36:11,132 --> 00:36:12,883
I like that! I’m with you, Mareng Erna!

774
00:36:12,883 --> 00:36:13,843
Excuse me,

775
00:36:13,843 --> 00:36:15,803
but I’m rooting for Kuya Estong because…

776
00:36:16,053 --> 00:36:18,431
he's pure Filipino, not half!

777
00:36:18,681 --> 00:36:20,266
And he's nice to go out with,

778
00:36:20,266 --> 00:36:21,867
even if it’s just around town.

779
00:36:21,892 --> 00:36:24,657
And he makes really good coffee!

780
00:36:25,104 --> 00:36:26,814
Because coffee is life, right?

781
00:36:26,814 --> 00:36:27,873
Where else would you look?

782
00:36:27,898 --> 00:36:29,150
Oh, how about you girl,

783
00:36:29,275 --> 00:36:30,568
who are you voting for?

784
00:36:30,568 --> 00:36:32,486
- Ah! My vote is...
- Right, he should go for Kuya Estong!

785
00:36:32,486 --> 00:36:34,613
- My vote is...
- For me, right?

786
00:36:34,905 --> 00:36:36,115
You all need to stop.

787
00:36:37,783 --> 00:36:39,493
You know what, you shouldn't be voting

788
00:36:39,493 --> 00:36:41,203
on who Belle chooses.

789
00:36:41,537 --> 00:36:43,706
Let's let her decide

790
00:36:43,706 --> 00:36:45,166
who she wants to choose, okay?

791
00:36:45,166 --> 00:36:46,083
Sorry, girl.

792
00:36:48,461 --> 00:36:49,345
Ahem!

793
00:36:49,503 --> 00:36:50,129
Oh my, it's Estong.

794
00:36:50,129 --> 00:36:51,130
Wait, we need to hide this.

795
00:36:52,673 --> 00:36:54,008
- Uh...
- Hey, it's Estong!

796
00:36:54,467 --> 00:36:55,818
how are you all doing?

797
00:36:55,843 --> 00:36:56,844
Kuya Estong,

798
00:36:56,844 --> 00:36:58,387
you’re ahead of the other guy now, huh?

799
00:36:59,346 --> 00:37:00,347
Of course.

800
00:37:00,639 --> 00:37:02,181
I don’t want him to beat me.

801
00:37:02,308 --> 00:37:03,934
Coffee? I brought coffee for everyone.

802
00:37:03,934 --> 00:37:05,102
See?

803
00:37:05,102 --> 00:37:06,645
Thank you so much!

804
00:37:10,357 --> 00:37:12,902
Girl, he really came with treats!

805
00:37:15,571 --> 00:37:16,197
Hey,

806
00:37:16,197 --> 00:37:17,239
is this the

807
00:37:17,239 --> 00:37:19,116
"Ysabelle's Mocha Magic"?

808
00:37:19,116 --> 00:37:20,701
Right? Mhm!

809
00:37:21,368 --> 00:37:23,496
I told you. That’s my guy.

810
00:37:28,334 --> 00:37:29,525
- Belle.
- Sweetheart.

811
00:37:32,402 --> 00:37:33,407
Good morning.

812
00:37:36,675 --> 00:37:37,462
Uh, Belle...

813
00:37:39,470 --> 00:37:40,471
This is our baby.

814
00:37:44,225 --> 00:37:45,290
There's a baby already?

815
00:37:46,852 --> 00:37:48,298
What are you talking about?

816
00:37:49,313 --> 00:37:50,689
Just kidding, come on.

817
00:37:51,106 --> 00:37:52,858
Uh… just imagine it’s me.

818
00:37:53,447 --> 00:37:53,901
Okay?

819
00:37:53,901 --> 00:37:55,236
He's me and...

820
00:37:55,945 --> 00:37:57,446
whenever you miss me or

821
00:37:57,446 --> 00:37:58,697
need some affection…

822
00:37:59,573 --> 00:38:00,491
just hug this.

823
00:38:04,495 --> 00:38:05,496
Good lord.

824
00:38:06,664 --> 00:38:07,540
They’ve got a surprise,

825
00:38:07,540 --> 00:38:09,166
He even brought a teddy bear!

826
00:38:16,048 --> 00:38:17,675
Girl, he's got a bigger budget!

827
00:38:21,053 --> 00:38:22,192
Good morning, everyone!

828
00:38:29,270 --> 00:38:30,192
Hi, Belle...

829
00:38:31,272 --> 00:38:32,208
For you.

830
00:38:35,818 --> 00:38:37,194
Hey, hey, get it, get it.

831
00:38:38,946 --> 00:38:40,270
Hey, isn't this...

832
00:38:40,364 --> 00:38:42,658
the popular chocolate?

833
00:38:42,783 --> 00:38:43,784
The tasty one...

834
00:38:43,909 --> 00:38:45,953
- from overseas, right?
- That's not tasty.

835
00:38:45,953 --> 00:38:47,496
- That's overrated.

836
00:38:47,496 --> 00:38:48,497
Oh, just taste it!

837
00:38:49,331 --> 00:38:50,916
Mhmmm!

838
00:38:51,834 --> 00:38:53,127
- Good, right?
- Give it back.

839
00:38:54,545 --> 00:38:55,546
Yeah, it's really good.

840
00:38:55,880 --> 00:38:58,007
- Taste it, Kuya Estong. It's really good.
- Bro.

841
00:38:58,924 --> 00:38:59,800
I'm on a diet, bro.

842
00:39:00,801 --> 00:39:02,177
Give us some, we're not on a diet.

843
00:39:08,117 --> 00:39:10,286
O to the M to the G!

844
00:39:10,311 --> 00:39:12,229
It's such a big teddy bear!

845
00:39:12,229 --> 00:39:14,106
This is such a big teddy bear!

846
00:39:14,106 --> 00:39:15,816
It's so nice!

847
00:39:16,025 --> 00:39:18,027
Thank you so much!

848
00:39:18,027 --> 00:39:20,029
I love it!

849
00:39:22,990 --> 00:39:25,534
Wow! Chocolates!

850
00:39:25,701 --> 00:39:28,454
Oh, Yeye wants chocolates!

851
00:39:32,291 --> 00:39:33,292
Hey, what are you guys doing?

852
00:39:34,001 --> 00:39:35,002
Quiet down.

853
00:39:35,419 --> 00:39:37,338
You're all too noisy.
You’re all over the place.

854
00:39:38,939 --> 00:39:41,108
Right, you've all been so loud!

855
00:39:41,133 --> 00:39:42,801
I’m gonna smack all of you!

856
00:39:44,511 --> 00:39:47,014
My dears, quiet down.

857
00:39:47,306 --> 00:39:49,433
You’re making me go deaf.

858
00:39:49,433 --> 00:39:52,519
My hips are starting
to hurt because of you.

859
00:39:53,187 --> 00:39:54,980
Be quiet, please.

860
00:39:59,109 --> 00:40:01,028
Yeah, can you guys quiet down, please?

861
00:40:01,445 --> 00:40:02,655
Not right now.

862
00:40:03,822 --> 00:40:05,950
- Belle, dear? Are you okay?
- Belle?

863
00:40:06,784 --> 00:40:07,785
- Sweetheart?
- Belle?

864
00:40:08,369 --> 00:40:09,495
Just leave me alone for now.

865
00:40:10,079 --> 00:40:12,331
- Belle. Belle, look at me.
- Ah, be quiet. Not now.

866
00:40:12,684 --> 00:40:14,917
- Look at me, Belle.
- Not now. Leave me alone, please.

867
00:40:14,917 --> 00:40:16,192
- Belle, just breathe.
- Not now, please!

868
00:40:16,710 --> 00:40:17,770
Look at me.

869
00:40:17,795 --> 00:40:19,046
Just breathe, okay?

870
00:40:20,089 --> 00:40:21,215
You're doing good, you're doing good.

871
00:40:22,508 --> 00:40:23,590
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

872
00:40:24,218 --> 00:40:25,344
Documentation for the show.

873
00:40:25,344 --> 00:40:26,904
- What? What show?
- Huh?

874
00:40:26,929 --> 00:40:27,950
Estong, it's okay.

875
00:40:28,305 --> 00:40:29,390
I agreed to this.

876
00:40:29,390 --> 00:40:30,557
Wait, hold on, what's going on, Belle?

877
00:40:30,557 --> 00:40:32,267
What's this? What is all this?

878
00:40:32,267 --> 00:40:33,333
Nang, it's okay.

879
00:40:34,019 --> 00:40:35,270
- Are you sure?
- Yes.

880
00:40:38,148 --> 00:40:39,106
Okay.

881
00:40:39,733 --> 00:40:41,068
Alright, just keep going.

882
00:40:58,585 --> 00:40:59,630
It's okay, Estong.

883
00:41:01,005 --> 00:41:02,089
Just leave us alone for now.

884
00:41:03,173 --> 00:41:04,145
Uh...

885
00:41:04,383 --> 00:41:05,759
Tita Barbs asked me to stay.

886
00:41:06,093 --> 00:41:07,450
I’ll stay here and keep an eye on you...

887
00:41:08,262 --> 00:41:09,122
and him.

888
00:41:14,977 --> 00:41:16,145
So, Belle? Are you ready?

889
00:41:17,563 --> 00:41:18,622
Lorenz...

890
00:41:18,647 --> 00:41:20,274
Just be careful with your questions, okay?

891
00:41:20,274 --> 00:41:22,276
Especially when it comes
to my traumatic memories.

892
00:41:23,777 --> 00:41:24,989
You might trigger it.

893
00:41:25,571 --> 00:41:26,520
Okay.

894
00:41:27,031 --> 00:41:28,036
Let's start.

895
00:41:37,124 --> 00:41:38,142
In three,

896
00:41:38,167 --> 00:41:39,122
two,

897
00:41:39,251 --> 00:41:40,044
one!

898
00:41:43,338 --> 00:41:44,348
Belle...

899
00:41:44,882 --> 00:41:46,169
Tell me your story.

900
00:41:46,592 --> 00:41:48,260
Start from the very beginning.

901
00:41:51,847 --> 00:41:52,794
Hello.

902
00:41:54,266 --> 00:41:55,142
My name is...

903
00:41:55,434 --> 00:41:56,560
Ysabelle Navarro.

904
00:41:57,936 --> 00:41:59,688
I have a mental disorder.

905
00:42:00,522 --> 00:42:03,150
It's called Dissociative Identity Disorder.

906
00:42:04,568 --> 00:42:05,569
D.I.D. for short.

907
00:42:09,490 --> 00:42:10,591
You're doing great.

908
00:42:10,616 --> 00:42:11,723
Just keep going, Belle.

909
00:42:13,118 --> 00:42:14,369
All my life...

910
00:42:15,037 --> 00:42:16,830
I thought there was
something wrong with me.

911
00:42:18,457 --> 00:42:19,583
All my life...

912
00:42:21,794 --> 00:42:23,837
I was ashamed of my personalities.

913
00:42:23,837 --> 00:42:24,980
Cut, cut, cut.

914
00:42:25,005 --> 00:42:25,881
Uh, Belle...

915
00:42:26,465 --> 00:42:28,675
Is it okay if you let all your
personalities come out?

916
00:42:29,384 --> 00:42:30,385
Let them all take over.

917
00:42:31,728 --> 00:42:32,778
Is it okay?

918
00:42:33,055 --> 00:42:33,931
Hey, what do you mean, merge?

919
00:42:33,931 --> 00:42:35,481
What do you think they are, spirits?

920
00:42:36,100 --> 00:42:36,973
Please.

921
00:42:37,935 --> 00:42:39,853
Lorenz, you wanted
me to tell my story, right?

922
00:42:40,395 --> 00:42:41,897
Can you let me be honest?

923
00:42:45,401 --> 00:42:46,614
Bro, take it slow, okay?

924
00:42:47,200 --> 00:42:48,445
That's not how you handle Belle.

925
00:42:49,238 --> 00:42:50,067
Okay.

926
00:42:50,739 --> 00:42:51,490
Just continue.

927
00:42:54,393 --> 00:42:56,561
What was that? What did I see? Huh?

928
00:42:57,329 --> 00:42:58,247
Answer me!

929
00:42:58,664 --> 00:43:00,541
- I didn’t do anything!
- What did you do?!

930
00:43:00,541 --> 00:43:02,459
I saw it! Just admit it!

931
00:43:02,459 --> 00:43:05,003
- Oh, so you're not going to admit it? Huh?!
- No!

932
00:43:05,754 --> 00:43:07,381
- You're not going to admit it?! Huh?!
- Enough, please!

933
00:43:07,506 --> 00:43:09,299
You had no right to do that to me!

934
00:43:09,458 --> 00:43:11,418
- You had no right!
- Stop it, please!

935
00:43:11,552 --> 00:43:12,845
And you’re taking my daughter with you, too?!

936
00:43:12,970 --> 00:43:14,972
You're taking my daughter
with you, too?! Huh?

937
00:43:14,972 --> 00:43:15,472
Huh?!

938
00:43:15,472 --> 00:43:17,891
- Enough.
- You can't replace me.

939
00:43:18,142 --> 00:43:19,101
I'm the only one.

940
00:43:19,101 --> 00:43:20,185
It should only be me.

941
00:43:20,644 --> 00:43:21,728
- Stop it.
- Only me!

942
00:43:22,312 --> 00:43:24,481
Don’t cry anymore,
Belle. I’m here now.

943
00:43:24,648 --> 00:43:26,191
I got your back.

944
00:43:31,947 --> 00:43:34,324
Bogart, I'm scared.

945
00:43:34,783 --> 00:43:36,702
- That's enough!
- Say yes.

946
00:43:37,286 --> 00:43:40,289
- No! Stop it!
- Yes!

947
00:43:41,915 --> 00:43:44,793
I told Ysabelle not to worry.

948
00:43:44,793 --> 00:43:47,963
I’ll deal with anyone who messes with her.

949
00:43:47,963 --> 00:43:50,257
I’ll handle them all. I’ll punch
every last one of them!

950
00:43:51,717 --> 00:43:52,901
But, Bogart...

951
00:43:52,926 --> 00:43:55,429
aren't you hurting other people instead?

952
00:43:58,765 --> 00:43:59,724
But...

953
00:44:00,154 --> 00:44:01,435
You just got used to it, didn’t you?

954
00:44:01,984 --> 00:44:03,777
Because your mom and dad

955
00:44:03,979 --> 00:44:05,105
were always hurting each other, right?

956
00:44:06,023 --> 00:44:07,774
Careful with what you're saying, bro.

957
00:44:09,902 --> 00:44:11,987
We really need to separate!

958
00:44:12,321 --> 00:44:13,443
I won't allow it.

959
00:44:13,780 --> 00:44:15,949
- We need to separate! I've had enough!
- Fine, leave!

960
00:44:16,116 --> 00:44:17,618
But Ysabelle stays with me.

961
00:44:17,618 --> 00:44:19,620
She’s coming with me! Now, let us out!

962
00:44:19,620 --> 00:44:20,662
Stop it, Michelle!

963
00:44:20,662 --> 00:44:21,955
Ricardo, I said let me
and my daughter out!

964
00:44:21,955 --> 00:44:23,916
Come on! Stop it.

965
00:44:23,916 --> 00:44:27,211
Girl, the vibe here is awful.

966
00:44:27,794 --> 00:44:31,048
Don't mind them. Just look at me.

967
00:44:31,048 --> 00:44:34,092
Which suits me better, pink or purple?

968
00:44:34,092 --> 00:44:34,801
Pink.

969
00:44:34,968 --> 00:44:38,347
Correct! Very demure, very cutesy!

970
00:44:38,847 --> 00:44:40,265
Stay right here! Stop it already.

971
00:44:40,265 --> 00:44:41,600
Ow! What’s wrong with you?!

972
00:44:41,600 --> 00:44:42,434
- See?
- What?

973
00:44:42,434 --> 00:44:44,228
Look what’s happening to our daughter!

974
00:44:44,478 --> 00:44:45,979
This is all your fault!

975
00:44:46,355 --> 00:44:47,731
This is all your fault!

976
00:44:48,357 --> 00:44:49,942
Stop it. We’re going to crash!

977
00:44:49,942 --> 00:44:52,069
- Let us out!
- Come on!

978
00:44:52,069 --> 00:44:53,654
Ricardo!

979
00:45:05,339 --> 00:45:06,548
Mommy?

980
00:45:07,084 --> 00:45:08,293
Daddy?

981
00:45:11,588 --> 00:45:13,382
Mommy? Daddy?

982
00:45:13,931 --> 00:45:14,723
Mommy!

983
00:45:16,510 --> 00:45:17,469
Daddy!

984
00:45:20,555 --> 00:45:22,641
Mommy! Daddy!

985
00:45:22,808 --> 00:45:25,519
Mommy! Daddy!

986
00:45:26,395 --> 00:45:27,896
Wake up!

987
00:45:29,856 --> 00:45:32,109
Please, wake up!

988
00:45:32,818 --> 00:45:34,319
Help!

989
00:45:37,656 --> 00:45:38,991
Well, you know,

990
00:45:38,991 --> 00:45:40,409
I’ve always said…

991
00:45:40,617 --> 00:45:42,786
I'm always here for my girl, Ysabelle,

992
00:45:42,786 --> 00:45:45,914
for my sister, because
you know, like her...

993
00:45:45,914 --> 00:45:50,711
oh, I don’t like anything ugly,
stinky, tacky, and all that.

994
00:45:50,711 --> 00:45:52,754
Like, O to the M to the G, seriously.

995
00:45:53,005 --> 00:45:55,924
You know, life is so
short, so we should all...

996
00:45:55,924 --> 00:45:57,134
love, love, love!

997
00:45:57,134 --> 00:45:57,592
You know,

998
00:45:57,592 --> 00:45:58,593
go, go, go!

999
00:45:58,593 --> 00:46:01,054
Like, go all out, like that!

1000
00:46:01,196 --> 00:46:03,699
And in true Cacai fashion!

1001
00:46:03,724 --> 00:46:05,892
Oh, I love that!

1002
00:46:05,892 --> 00:46:08,245
That's so giving! Oh...

1003
00:46:08,270 --> 00:46:10,230
Can I add to what Estong said?

1004
00:46:10,814 --> 00:46:11,982
Go ahead, go ahead.

1005
00:46:12,482 --> 00:46:13,404
But...

1006
00:46:14,067 --> 00:46:15,736
Is it okay if you tell us about

1007
00:46:15,986 --> 00:46:16,903
the car accident?

1008
00:46:17,154 --> 00:46:18,255
Why it happened?

1009
00:46:19,489 --> 00:46:20,411
Uh...

1010
00:46:20,699 --> 00:46:21,842
This time...

1011
00:46:21,867 --> 00:46:22,868
Slower, Cacai.

1012
00:46:23,035 --> 00:46:24,076
More detailed.

1013
00:46:25,579 --> 00:46:26,705
I just need it for soundbites.

1014
00:46:27,956 --> 00:46:29,082
They were fighting over

1015
00:46:29,249 --> 00:46:30,125
who you were going to live with.

1016
00:46:32,060 --> 00:46:33,170
So, that means

1017
00:46:33,670 --> 00:46:34,671
you’re the reason

1018
00:46:34,963 --> 00:46:36,131
you got into the accident.

1019
00:46:36,590 --> 00:46:37,622
Wait, hold on.

1020
00:46:38,133 --> 00:46:39,426
Do you really need to ask that?

1021
00:46:40,093 --> 00:46:41,636
Belle had nothing to do
with what happened.

1022
00:46:42,179 --> 00:46:43,430
It was an accident, okay?

1023
00:46:44,639 --> 00:46:46,558
Sorry, I'm not very comfortable.

1024
00:46:46,558 --> 00:46:48,185
I don't want to answer that question.

1025
00:46:48,185 --> 00:46:49,644
I refuse to answer that question.

1026
00:46:49,644 --> 00:46:50,812
I'm sorry.

1027
00:46:52,397 --> 00:46:53,607
Odd one out!

1028
00:46:54,149 --> 00:46:55,651
Odd one out!

1029
00:46:57,069 --> 00:46:58,487
Odd one out!

1030
00:46:59,154 --> 00:47:00,238
Odd one out!

1031
00:47:00,781 --> 00:47:01,656
Let's play!

1032
00:47:02,282 --> 00:47:03,200
I don’t want to!

1033
00:47:05,077 --> 00:47:06,203
Why don’t you want to?

1034
00:47:06,411 --> 00:47:07,304
I don't like you!

1035
00:47:07,329 --> 00:47:08,622
I'm scared of you!

1036
00:47:09,956 --> 00:47:11,833
But, I'm not scary.

1037
00:47:11,833 --> 00:47:14,115
We just don’t want to! You’re crazy!

1038
00:47:14,753 --> 00:47:16,046
Come on, let's play.

1039
00:47:16,046 --> 00:47:16,826
Sure!

1040
00:47:24,930 --> 00:47:27,391
Yeye, they don’t like me.

1041
00:47:27,391 --> 00:47:30,201
Yeye likes Ate Belle!

1042
00:47:30,519 --> 00:47:33,021
Come! You and I can play
together instead!

1043
00:47:49,037 --> 00:47:49,997
Yeye...

1044
00:47:51,123 --> 00:47:52,443
Why don't they like you?

1045
00:47:53,458 --> 00:47:54,584
Is it true that your insane?

1046
00:47:55,502 --> 00:47:56,962
Is that why they don’t
want to play with you?

1047
00:47:57,712 --> 00:47:58,693
Is that why?

1048
00:48:08,306 --> 00:48:09,391
Uh, Yeye.

1049
00:48:10,308 --> 00:48:11,643
Yeye, Yeye!

1050
00:48:12,602 --> 00:48:13,520
No, that's not true.

1051
00:48:13,729 --> 00:48:14,996
Yeye, that's not true.

1052
00:48:15,021 --> 00:48:16,314
Do you want me to be your playmate instead?

1053
00:48:17,482 --> 00:48:19,067
Here, I brought you something.

1054
00:48:19,443 --> 00:48:20,444
Your favorite. Lollipop.

1055
00:48:20,902 --> 00:48:22,738
Lollipop. Here, a lollipop.

1056
00:48:23,655 --> 00:48:25,782
- Lollipop!
- Wow, Lollipop.

1057
00:48:26,116 --> 00:48:27,117
Lollipop.

1058
00:48:29,786 --> 00:48:32,664
- Lollipop! Lollipop! Lollipop!
- Watch how you ask your questions.

1059
00:48:33,248 --> 00:48:34,583
One more, I’m warning you.

1060
00:48:35,083 --> 00:48:36,084
I might just punch you.

1061
00:48:36,951 --> 00:48:38,336
That’s just how documentaries are, bro.

1062
00:48:39,045 --> 00:48:40,422
If you don’t want to see that,

1063
00:48:40,589 --> 00:48:41,756
just leave the room.

1064
00:48:48,930 --> 00:48:50,265
Sweetheart. Whoo!

1065
00:48:52,058 --> 00:48:53,477
- All right!
- Dear, you know what...

1066
00:48:53,477 --> 00:48:55,604
We found some of your
Nonong's cassette tapes

1067
00:48:55,604 --> 00:48:56,730
while we were rummaging
through some things.

1068
00:48:57,105 --> 00:48:59,983
Your mom said you two used
to love listening to music.

1069
00:49:02,152 --> 00:49:03,904
So your Nanang and I thought

1070
00:49:04,237 --> 00:49:06,865
we’d buy you some new tapes to listen to.

1071
00:49:10,952 --> 00:49:11,685
There.

1072
00:49:12,329 --> 00:49:13,333
Give it a try.

1073
00:49:15,916 --> 00:49:17,167
Happy Birthday!

1074
00:49:17,167 --> 00:49:18,710
Happy Birthday, sweetheart!

1075
00:49:31,014 --> 00:49:31,890
Ysabelle, dear?

1076
00:49:33,391 --> 00:49:34,443
Are you okay?

1077
00:49:43,276 --> 00:49:44,653
I'm not Ysabelle.

1078
00:49:45,362 --> 00:49:46,696
My name is Tristan.

1079
00:49:47,906 --> 00:49:50,033
Ysabelle is really sad,

1080
00:49:50,283 --> 00:49:51,660
so I'm keeping her company.

1081
00:50:03,880 --> 00:50:04,731
Uh...

1082
00:50:04,756 --> 00:50:05,757
Cut, cut, cut.

1083
00:50:05,882 --> 00:50:06,716
Stop for a moment.

1084
00:50:06,716 --> 00:50:07,759
Tristan, are you okay?

1085
00:50:09,594 --> 00:50:10,971
I’m sorry about that.

1086
00:50:12,264 --> 00:50:13,255
As for me...

1087
00:50:14,558 --> 00:50:17,227
I just really wanted to
be there for Ysabelle.

1088
00:50:18,353 --> 00:50:19,604
I just didn't want her to feel...

1089
00:50:20,772 --> 00:50:22,399
like she was all alone.

1090
00:50:23,608 --> 00:50:24,544
Don't you think...

1091
00:50:25,735 --> 00:50:28,488
you just became a burden when you came
into Barbs and Kent's lives?

1092
00:50:29,030 --> 00:50:30,323
And then you also entered Belle's.

1093
00:50:31,658 --> 00:50:33,044
Are you deliberately trying to provoke her?

1094
00:50:33,785 --> 00:50:34,661
Are you doing this on purpose?

1095
00:50:37,122 --> 00:50:38,115
Estong.

1096
00:50:38,999 --> 00:50:39,990
It's okay.

1097
00:50:41,084 --> 00:50:43,003
Let him be. He knows what he's doing.

1098
00:50:44,421 --> 00:50:45,310
Belle?

1099
00:51:11,615 --> 00:51:13,491
I miss you so much, Mommy.

1100
00:51:33,720 --> 00:51:34,596
Mommy.

1101
00:51:53,448 --> 00:51:54,649
Lola, would you like some water?

1102
00:51:55,492 --> 00:51:57,035
No, I'm okay, dear.

1103
00:52:02,290 --> 00:52:04,834
[Belle snoring]

1104
00:52:06,378 --> 00:52:07,251
Lola?

1105
00:52:08,129 --> 00:52:09,798
- Lo...Lola Iska?
- Lola? Lola? Lola?

1106
00:52:10,131 --> 00:52:10,962
- Lola!
- Hello?

1107
00:52:11,633 --> 00:52:12,571
Yeah?

1108
00:52:13,385 --> 00:52:14,361
What was that?

1109
00:52:14,386 --> 00:52:15,512
We're doing an interview.

1110
00:52:16,137 --> 00:52:17,430
Oh...where were we?

1111
00:52:17,430 --> 00:52:18,723
Sorry, I fell asleep.

1112
00:52:19,891 --> 00:52:20,742
Ah,

1113
00:52:20,767 --> 00:52:22,185
the thing you always remind Belle about.

1114
00:52:23,144 --> 00:52:24,145
Ahhh...

1115
00:52:26,106 --> 00:52:28,983
I have always told her...

1116
00:52:30,985 --> 00:52:34,364
that we’re always here for her.

1117
00:52:35,281 --> 00:52:37,784
No matter how much she pushes us away,

1118
00:52:37,951 --> 00:52:40,870
no matter how much she tries to avoid us…

1119
00:52:41,371 --> 00:52:43,915
we’re not going anywhere.

1120
00:52:44,874 --> 00:52:46,543
Because we're a family.

1121
00:52:47,043 --> 00:52:48,920
And that old photograph…

1122
00:52:49,838 --> 00:52:52,048
doesn’t just remind us

1123
00:52:52,048 --> 00:52:54,342
of the people who are gone.

1124
00:52:54,801 --> 00:52:56,761
It also reminds us

1125
00:52:57,053 --> 00:52:59,973
of the people who are still here.

1126
00:53:00,432 --> 00:53:01,891
And I hope

1127
00:53:02,267 --> 00:53:04,227
she can accept us,

1128
00:53:04,853 --> 00:53:07,105
because we’re here

1129
00:53:07,522 --> 00:53:11,067
to protect her and love her.

1130
00:53:12,360 --> 00:53:13,069
Hm?

1131
00:53:15,864 --> 00:53:16,715
But,

1132
00:53:16,740 --> 00:53:17,969
why do you talk like that?

1133
00:53:18,742 --> 00:53:19,719
You sound drunk.

1134
00:53:20,118 --> 00:53:22,120
Aren’t you just one of
Belle’s personalities?

1135
00:53:24,998 --> 00:53:25,749
Lola Iska...

1136
00:53:26,541 --> 00:53:27,657
you're not real.

1137
00:53:30,044 --> 00:53:31,379
You're not real.

1138
00:53:32,464 --> 00:53:33,590
Oh, man...

1139
00:53:33,882 --> 00:53:36,426
You're making a documentary,
and you didn't even research about D.I.D.?

1140
00:53:37,010 --> 00:53:38,887
Lola Iska is part of who Belle is.

1141
00:53:39,345 --> 00:53:40,096
All of them are.

1142
00:53:48,855 --> 00:53:52,066
When Belle’s special day
with you, Lorenz, was ruined…

1143
00:53:52,817 --> 00:53:55,195
she was terrified when
she saw the fear in your eyes...

1144
00:53:55,195 --> 00:53:56,654
that you were afraid of her…

1145
00:53:57,197 --> 00:53:59,365
that you might not be able to love her.

1146
00:53:59,783 --> 00:54:01,493
I blamed everything on who I was,

1147
00:54:01,493 --> 00:54:03,745
so I tried to force myself to erase it all.

1148
00:54:56,965 --> 00:54:57,465
Belle!

1149
00:54:57,799 --> 00:54:58,925
Don't do it!

1150
00:54:59,968 --> 00:55:01,302
Don’t hurt yourself.

1151
00:55:01,302 --> 00:55:02,804
There are so many people who love you.

1152
00:55:02,971 --> 00:55:04,430
Don't hurt all of us!

1153
00:55:05,139 --> 00:55:06,241
Who are you?

1154
00:55:06,724 --> 00:55:07,600
I don't know you.

1155
00:55:09,769 --> 00:55:10,770
I'm Ysa.

1156
00:55:11,938 --> 00:55:13,122
Then, Ysa.

1157
00:55:13,147 --> 00:55:14,274
Leave me alone.

1158
00:55:14,274 --> 00:55:16,192
Mind your own business.

1159
00:55:25,869 --> 00:55:26,975
Belle!

1160
00:55:28,371 --> 00:55:29,497
Belle, don’t do this.

1161
00:55:29,622 --> 00:55:30,932
Just calm down, Belle.

1162
00:55:30,957 --> 00:55:31,741
Don't!

1163
00:55:32,584 --> 00:55:33,553
Belle! Please!

1164
00:55:37,797 --> 00:55:38,819
Belle!

1165
00:56:37,231 --> 00:56:39,525
Belle is just resting, Nanang Barbs.

1166
00:56:39,859 --> 00:56:41,486
I'll be with you, for now.

1167
00:56:45,531 --> 00:56:48,117
I only did what I thought was right.

1168
00:56:51,329 --> 00:56:52,455
I tried everything.

1169
00:56:52,455 --> 00:56:53,456
I did everything.

1170
00:56:54,457 --> 00:56:55,249
When...

1171
00:56:55,792 --> 00:56:57,043
Belle was resting,

1172
00:56:57,961 --> 00:56:59,796
I still continued doing
the things she wanted.

1173
00:57:01,255 --> 00:57:02,382
Like her dreams.

1174
00:57:03,299 --> 00:57:04,550
Because I was hoping…

1175
00:57:06,094 --> 00:57:07,095
we were hoping…

1176
00:57:08,721 --> 00:57:11,015
that she’d accept us when she woke up.

1177
00:57:13,893 --> 00:57:15,645
That she’d be ready to love.

1178
00:57:16,312 --> 00:57:19,023
And love those who love her completely.

1179
00:57:20,608 --> 00:57:21,876
But...

1180
00:57:21,908 --> 00:57:23,785
what you did was kind of
embarrassing, you know?

1181
00:57:24,577 --> 00:57:26,579
Even I’m scared for myself.

1182
00:57:28,032 --> 00:57:30,326
Because no matter how we look at it…

1183
00:57:31,828 --> 00:57:33,204
you’re still not in your right mind.

1184
00:57:40,670 --> 00:57:41,879
Oh, so you’re a prick, huh?

1185
00:57:41,879 --> 00:57:42,422
You’ve been at it this whole time.

1186
00:57:42,422 --> 00:57:43,631
What, you wanna fight?

1187
00:57:43,631 --> 00:57:44,716
What the hell are you talking about?

1188
00:57:44,716 --> 00:57:45,800
You’ve been pushing it this whole time!

1189
00:57:45,800 --> 00:57:46,801
What, you wanna fight?

1190
00:57:46,801 --> 00:57:48,136
Bro, don’t film that.

1191
00:57:48,136 --> 00:57:49,178
Stay out of this.

1192
00:57:49,387 --> 00:57:50,930
People aren’t supposed
to see that. Come on!

1193
00:57:50,930 --> 00:57:51,681
I don't care.

1194
00:57:51,681 --> 00:57:53,391
OMG! You're so bad!

1195
00:57:53,391 --> 00:57:54,350
You're such a jerk!

1196
00:57:54,350 --> 00:57:57,854
- How dare you! How could you? I hate you!
- Stop that! Stop what you're doing!

1197
00:57:57,854 --> 00:57:58,688
You're so...

1198
00:57:59,605 --> 00:58:00,581
Yeye?

1199
00:58:00,606 --> 00:58:02,525
- Come on, move aside!
- Ah! You're bad!

1200
00:58:02,525 --> 00:58:04,986
- You're fighting with Ate Ysabelle!
- Come on. Move!

1201
00:58:06,863 --> 00:58:07,756
Estong.

1202
00:58:08,948 --> 00:58:10,045
Estong, move out of the way.

1203
00:58:10,783 --> 00:58:11,784
Enough, that's enough!

1204
00:58:11,784 --> 00:58:13,036
What are you doing, Estong? Move aside!

1205
00:58:15,204 --> 00:58:16,914
That doesn't make you cool, bro.

1206
00:58:17,173 --> 00:58:18,424
Don’t you feel sorry for Ysabelle?

1207
00:58:18,624 --> 00:58:19,625
Estong, that's enough.

1208
00:58:19,959 --> 00:58:20,787
It's okay.

1209
00:58:21,961 --> 00:58:23,212
You, young man.

1210
00:58:23,421 --> 00:58:25,965
Is that what your parents taught you?

1211
00:58:26,424 --> 00:58:27,884
I can't believe it!

1212
00:58:27,884 --> 00:58:29,510
Oh my God, we trusted you!

1213
00:58:31,179 --> 00:58:32,889
I saw it, so just admit it!

1214
00:58:32,889 --> 00:58:35,183
Just let me and my daughter out!

1215
00:58:36,976 --> 00:58:37,869
Belle?

1216
00:58:37,894 --> 00:58:38,745
Belle?

1217
00:58:38,770 --> 00:58:39,771
Belle, are you okay?

1218
00:58:40,605 --> 00:58:42,148
I don't like you! You're crazy!

1219
00:58:43,171 --> 00:58:44,923
Mommy! Daddy!

1220
00:58:45,318 --> 00:58:46,444
Belle!

1221
00:58:51,866 --> 00:58:52,825
So, was that a good take?

1222
00:58:55,286 --> 00:58:56,256
The best!

1223
00:59:05,463 --> 00:59:06,714
Hello, Ms. Valdez?

1224
00:59:07,882 --> 00:59:08,883
Hi, Lorenz.

1225
00:59:08,966 --> 00:59:10,051
What’s the status?

1226
00:59:10,301 --> 00:59:12,011
Have you gotten the whole story yet?

1227
00:59:12,637 --> 00:59:14,305
Yes, yes, yes. It's great.

1228
00:59:15,181 --> 00:59:16,766
And for sure, this will go viral.

1229
00:59:17,642 --> 00:59:20,436
Did you see how it affected her when you
pointed your lens at her?

1230
00:59:21,312 --> 00:59:22,772
You might trigger her even more.

1231
00:59:22,980 --> 00:59:25,024
OMG!

1232
00:59:29,904 --> 00:59:30,613
Good!

1233
00:59:30,738 --> 00:59:32,698
We’ve been building this up for weeks.

1234
00:59:33,074 --> 00:59:34,867
Management is excited about it.

1235
00:59:35,076 --> 00:59:36,077
We cannot lose it.

1236
00:59:37,954 --> 00:59:38,896
Bee...

1237
00:59:39,163 --> 00:59:41,541
You know I will do everything
for this segment.

1238
00:59:42,375 --> 00:59:43,417
And also for us.

1239
00:59:46,129 --> 00:59:47,053
You know...

1240
00:59:48,297 --> 00:59:49,632
I'll do everything I can for this.

1241
00:59:49,632 --> 00:59:50,758
So you can be proud of me.

1242
00:59:51,050 --> 00:59:52,051
Especially in our work.

1243
00:59:53,094 --> 00:59:54,162
Thank you, Bee!

1244
00:59:54,345 --> 00:59:56,514
This is the break you’ve been waiting for.

1245
00:59:57,223 --> 00:59:59,767
One story...and everything changes.

1246
01:00:00,184 --> 01:00:00,977
Congrats!

1247
01:00:00,977 --> 01:00:01,850
So...

1248
01:00:02,436 --> 01:00:05,064
let's just talk about
the materials I shot, okay?

1249
01:00:06,274 --> 01:00:07,692
I love you so much, Bee!

1250
01:00:12,697 --> 01:00:13,678
What was that?

1251
01:00:16,409 --> 01:00:17,410
"Bee?" What an asshole.

1252
01:00:18,411 --> 01:00:19,787
So, you’ve got someone after all.

1253
01:00:20,788 --> 01:00:23,040
And you’re leading Belle on
and making a fool of her too?

1254
01:00:23,685 --> 01:00:24,750
For what?

1255
01:00:24,750 --> 01:00:26,502
For your segment? Huh?

1256
01:00:27,295 --> 01:00:28,662
You don't have an ounce
of sympathy for Belle.

1257
01:00:29,964 --> 01:00:31,591
Just how far does your cruelty go, huh?

1258
01:00:32,967 --> 01:00:34,302
- I should...
- Should what?!

1259
01:00:35,428 --> 01:00:36,498
Are you gonna tell on me?

1260
01:00:37,305 --> 01:00:38,681
Go ahead! Tell her!

1261
01:00:39,140 --> 01:00:40,146
Do you think...

1262
01:00:40,266 --> 01:00:43,227
anyone would believe a guy
who only makes coffee for a living?

1263
01:00:49,670 --> 01:00:50,693
You asshole!

1264
01:00:51,319 --> 01:00:52,612
Huh? What?!

1265
01:00:53,946 --> 01:00:56,157
Is this the guy who can
only make coffee?

1266
01:00:56,574 --> 01:00:57,482
Estong!

1267
01:01:02,747 --> 01:01:04,540
Belle, don’t go near
him. He’s just using you.

1268
01:01:06,000 --> 01:01:07,001
What do you mean?

1269
01:01:07,668 --> 01:01:08,795
What are you saying?

1270
01:01:09,503 --> 01:01:10,504
Come here, I’ll tell you.

1271
01:01:10,504 --> 01:01:11,505
No, say it right here.

1272
01:01:12,965 --> 01:01:13,889
What is it?

1273
01:01:18,262 --> 01:01:19,805
That man could never love you.

1274
01:01:20,806 --> 01:01:21,693
Why?

1275
01:01:21,807 --> 01:01:23,310
Is it because of my condition?

1276
01:01:23,768 --> 01:01:25,228
You’re so judgmental, Estong.

1277
01:01:25,561 --> 01:01:26,560
Belle, it's not like that.

1278
01:01:27,021 --> 01:01:28,147
He's just using you!

1279
01:01:33,527 --> 01:01:35,154
Estong, I'm the one who's using you.

1280
01:01:37,573 --> 01:01:38,950
Actually, both of you.

1281
01:01:42,119 --> 01:01:43,170
Huh?

1282
01:01:44,956 --> 01:01:45,951
You.

1283
01:01:59,068 --> 01:02:01,339
Belle, you know,
Estong is a good person.

1284
01:02:01,889 --> 01:02:04,267
So what you did to him
was very wrong.

1285
01:02:05,017 --> 01:02:06,102
Can we talk?

1286
01:02:06,852 --> 01:02:07,937
Are you going to order?

1287
01:02:08,717 --> 01:02:11,357
Because if not, maybe
you should leave.

1288
01:02:11,691 --> 01:02:12,775
There you go.

1289
01:02:13,484 --> 01:02:15,319
He’s got some character
development now.

1290
01:02:16,153 --> 01:02:18,406
Oh, the day's still young.

1291
01:02:18,619 --> 01:02:20,120
I know your brother.

1292
01:02:20,283 --> 01:02:22,285
Kuya, I think she really regrets it.

1293
01:02:22,285 --> 01:02:24,495
She’s been here
all day waiting for you

1294
01:02:26,080 --> 01:02:27,014
That's her choice.

1295
01:02:27,540 --> 01:02:28,582
I'm proud of you.

1296
01:02:29,583 --> 01:02:31,043
You apologized to Estong...

1297
01:02:31,711 --> 01:02:33,045
you talked to Lorenz.

1298
01:02:34,255 --> 01:02:35,295
Good job.

1299
01:02:36,435 --> 01:02:37,633
I don't need your advice.

1300
01:02:38,050 --> 01:02:40,428
I don't need your help,
or anyone else's.

1301
01:02:40,511 --> 01:02:42,193
I don't need all of your help!

1302
01:02:43,347 --> 01:02:45,975
You don't have to handle
everything on your own.

1303
01:02:46,600 --> 01:02:48,811
You don't have
to prove to yourself

1304
01:02:48,811 --> 01:02:49,979
that you can do it alone.

1305
01:02:49,979 --> 01:02:51,355
You're the one who went viral!

1306
01:02:51,355 --> 01:02:52,732
- Here, look!
- What are you talking about?

1307
01:02:53,357 --> 01:02:55,276
Sweetheart, I thought Lorenz
wasn't going to release that.
